Origin
------

They are mechanically generated from the RUCKUS One Consolidated OpenAPI
specification. The generator reformats the specification into Markdown; it does
not rewrite it. As a result these files reproduce, verbatim, descriptive text
authored by RUCKUS Networks — endpoint summaries and descriptions, parameter
descriptions, and schema field descriptions.

That content is Copyright (c) RUCKUS Networks and/or its affiliates. All rights
in it are reserved by its owner.

The upstream specification declares no redistribution license. Its OpenAPI
`info.license` field points to the RUCKUS Cloud Privacy Policy
(https://support.ruckuswireless.com/ruckus-one-privacy-policy), which is a
privacy policy rather than a grant of rights.

Why it is included
------------------

The r1mcp server reads these files locally to answer `r1_list_groups` and
`r1_get_docs` without a network call. They are included for the convenience of
users who already have authorized access to the RUCKUS One platform and its API
documentation.

